'''Crabclaw Isle''' is a small island just south of the [[Hosidius]] coast. Players can reach the island by paying [[Sandicrahb]] 10,000 coins. Completing the easy [[Kourend & Kebos Diary]] will allow players to access it for half the price. Completing the medium Kourend & Kebos Diary will allow players to access the island for free.

There are 40 [[sand crab]]s scattered throughout the isle, with several spots containing three/four crabs near one tile.

==Transportation==
* Casting the [[Minigame Teleport]] spell to [[Tithe Farm]] and run south. 
* Use a [[Hosidius teleport]] or exit a [[player-owned house]] in Hosidius and go south.
* Use a planted [[spirit tree (Farming)|spirit tree]] and run south-east.

==Treasure Trails==
The island contains the location of a [[Treasure_Trails/Guide/Coordinates/Master|master clue]] coordinate.

